msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:374
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/aws/invoiceCosting/8govcloudCosting.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:378
msgid "AWS Reserved Instances and Savings Plans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:380
msgid ""
"Amazon AWS public cloud offers Reserved Instances (RI) and Savings Plans,"
" which allow organizations with consistent use patterns to reduce cloud "
"spend significantly. |morpheus| analyzes AWS cloud usage and spend, which"
" allows it to make intelligent recommendations that can lead to "
"significant savings. This data can be reviewed in the Reservation "
"Recommendations and Savings Plan Recommendations tables on any AWS Cloud "
"detail page (Infrastructure > Clouds > Selected Amazon Cloud)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:382
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Savings Plans potentially offer greater than 70% savings in exchange for "
"a commitment to consistent usage levels for a 1- or 3-year term. "
"|morpheus| provides Savings Plan guidance based on learned analytics; "
"allowing you to analyze Savings Plans based on different term commitments"
" and upfront costs to choose the best savings plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:384
msgid ".. image:: /images/integration_guides/clouds/aws/savingsPlan.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:386
msgid ""
"Reserved Instances (RI) provide a discounted hourly rate and optional "
"capacity reservation for EC2 instances. AWS billing automatically applies"
" your RI-discounted rate when the attributes of EC2 instance usage match "
"attributes of an active RI. |morpheus| provides RI guidance based on "
"learned analytics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:388
msgid ".. image:: /images/integration_guides/clouds/aws/ri.png"
msgstr ""

